      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Zero‑Scratch Guarantee: 7‑Layer Shock‑Absorbent Packaging for Bangalore‑Kochi Bike Moves</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>Transporting a high‑end bicycle from Bangalore to Kochi demands a packaging system that neutralises every jolt on the road. Our patented 7‑layer shock‑absorbent solution creates a zero‑scratch guarantee, wrapping the bike in a cascade of engineered barriers that work together to dissipate impact, control vibration, and shield every delicate component.</p>

<h3>Layer 1 – Ultra‑Light Polyethylene Film</h3>
<p>First, a breathable, anti‑static polyethylene film encases the frame, preventing moisture ingress while allowing air circulation. Its smooth surface reduces friction against the bike’s paint, acting as a primary barrier against scratches.</p>

<h3>Layer 2 – Recycled Foam Padding</h3>
<p>Next, a 10 mm sheet of recycled EVA foam hugs the handlebars, seat post, and fork. The foam’s closed‑cell structure absorbs low‑frequency shocks, cushioning the most vulnerable contact points without adding bulk.</p>

<h3>Layer 3 – Reinforced Corrugated Cardboard</h3>
<p>A double‑wall, 5‑mm corrugated cardboard core surrounds the foam, offering rigidity and structural integrity. Its fluted design distributes weight evenly, preventing point‑load stress on the frame during handling.</p>

<h3>Layer 4 – High‑Density Polyethylene (HDPE) Corner Inserts</h3>
<p>Custom‑moulded HDPE inserts protect the bike’s corners and tube ends. Their high impact resistance absorbs sudden blows, especially at junctions where the frame meets the wheels.</p>

<h3>Layer 5 – Gel‑Infused Silicone Strips</h3>
<p>Thin silicone strips infused with gel are placed along the chainstay and down tube. The gel’s viscoelastic properties convert kinetic energy into heat, dampening vibrations that travel through the chassis.</p>

<h3>Layer 6 – Anti‑Static Mylar Blanket</h3>
<p>A reflective Mylar blanket wraps the entire assembly, shielding electronic components such as the speed sensor and shifter from static discharge while adding an extra layer of moisture protection.</p>

<h3>Layer 7 – Heavy‑Duty Polypropylene Outer Sleeve</h3>
<p>The final shell is a rugged, UV‑resistant polypropylene sleeve with reinforced stitching. It safeguards the inner layers from external abrasions, rain, and temperature fluctuations throughout the 1,500 km journey.</p>

