      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Full Coverage: Insurance and Documentation Essentials for Bike Transport From Bangalore To Kochi</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><div style="background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.08); border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b; border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0; padding: 18px 22px; margin: 24px 0;"><h4 style="color: #f59e0b; font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 6px 0;"><i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle" style="margin-right: 8px;"></i>Important Logistics Advisory</h4><div style="color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.92rem; margin: 0; line-height: 1.6;"><strong>MANDATORY INSURANCE AND DOCUMENTATION ALERT – BIKES TRANSPORTED FROM BANGALORE TO KOCHI</strong></p>

<div style="background:#fff3cd;border:1px solid #ffeeba;padding:12px;margin:10px 0;">
  <p><strong>WARNING:</strong> Ignoring any of the items below can lead to fines, transport delays, or denial of claim settlement.</div></div>
</div>

<p>Before you hand over your two‑wheeler to a logistics partner, make sure the following critical requirements are fully satisfied. Each point is non‑negotiable under Indian transport and tax law.</p>

<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #f59e0b22; color: #f59e0b; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">01</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">IRDAI‑approved insurance coverage</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The policy must be issued by an insurer registered with the Insurance Regulatory and Development Authority of India. It should explicitly cover “in‑transit damage or total loss” for the bike’s declared market value.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">e‑Way bill</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Mandatory for any consignment exceeding ₹50,000. Generate the bill on the GST portal, enter the correct HSN code (8711), and attach the QR code to the bike’s transport documents.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #3b82f622; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">03</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">GST invoice</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Provide a tax‑compliant invoice that lists the bike’s make, model, chassis number, registration details, and the exact transaction value. The invoice must bear the supplier’s GSTIN and the buyer’s GSTIN (if applicable).</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #a855f722; color: #a855f7; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">04</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Transporter’s permits and licences</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Verify that the carrier holds a valid Goods Carriage Licence, a State Transport Permit for Karnataka and Kerala, and a valid vehicle fitness certificate.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #ec489922; color: #ec4899; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">05</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Secure loading &amp; packing proof</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Request photographs or a video of the bike being loaded, strapped, and covered. This visual record is essential for any later claim.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
