<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Bike Transport from Bangalore to Kochi | Call 8409531615
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the typical transit time for bike transport from Bangalore to Kochi?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The standard door‑to‑door bike transport from Bangalore to Kochi takes approximately 2‑3 days, depending on traffic conditions and any unforeseen roadwork along the NH 44 and NH 66 corridors. Our real‑time GPS monitoring ensures you can verify the exact progress, and we always aim to deliver within the promised window.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is my bike protected against scratches during the move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Each bike is wrapped in a seven‑layer shock‑absorbent system that includes heavy‑duty bubble wrap, high‑density foam edge protectors, corrugated fiberboard, weather‑proof stretch film, and custom wooden crates for delicate parts. The hydraulic ramp trailer also features anti‑scratch wheel chocks and ratchet lashings, guaranteeing a zero‑scratch guarantee throughout the journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for bike shipping between Bangalore and Kochi?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You will need a valid government‑issued bike registration certificate, a copy of your PAN or Aadhaar for GST invoicing, a signed transport agreement, and an e‑Way bill generated for the interstate movement. Our team prepares all paperwork, ensuring compliance with IBA mover code and IRDAI insurance regulations.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is insurance mandatory and what does it cover?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, we provide IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance for every bike shipment. The policy covers accidental damage, theft, and loss of parts up to the declared value of the vehicle. In the unlikely event of a claim, the process is streamlined with our dedicated support team handling documentation and settlement within 7‑10 business days.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my bike in real time during the journey?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Each of our specialized container trucks is equipped with satellite GPS that feeds live location data to a secure customer portal. You receive instant alerts at each major checkpoint—departure, en‑route, and arrival—so you can monitor your bike’s exact position throughout the 850 km transit.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How are the rates calculated and are there any hidden charges?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our rates are transparent and based on four components: distance‑based mileage, fuel surcharge, handling and loading fee, and the mandatory insurance premium. There are no hidden fees; any additional service—such as extra padding for oversized accessories or expedited delivery—will be quoted upfront and confirmed before the move begins.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
